{'symbol': 'INVH', 'date': '2023-04-27 16:30:00', 'title': "MOODY'S REVISES INVITATION HOMES' RATING OUTLOOK FROM ‘STABLE' TO ‘POSITIVE'", 'text': "DALLAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INVITATION HOMES INC. (NYSE: INVH) (“INVITATION HOMES” OR THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT MOODY'S INVESTORS SERVICE (“MOODY'S”) REVISED ITS RATING OUTLOOK FOR THE COMPANY FROM ‘STABLE' TO ‘POSITIVE' AND AFFIRMED ALL OF THE COMPANY'S RATINGS, INCLUDING THE BAA3 SENIOR UNSECURED RATING. IN ITS PUBLIC ANNOUNCEMENT ON THE MATTER, MOODY'S EMPHASIZED THE COMPANY'S “SCALE AS A LEADING SINGLE-FAMILY HOME (SFR) OWNER/OPERATOR WITH A STRENGTHENED BALANCE SHEET WITH IMPROVED L."}